#X text 20 1150 The trim runs first \, so the write never lands past the end of a text about to be shortened., f 46;
#X text 420 1150 list append: the message arrives with the level as its selector \, which text set has no method for., f 46;
#X text 820 1150 Capture is unconditional and only the write is rate-limited \, by a dirty flag and a 2 s metro \, so an error storm cannot thrash the SD card., f 46;
#X text 1220 1150 quitting forces a last flush inside mother's 100 ms. u_mother-stub never sends quitting \, so the syntax check cannot trip it., f 46;
#X text 20 1300 write -c \, so the log is plain lines for grep \, tail and awk (Reference \, pure-data)., f 46;
#X text 620 1300 text set past the end appends \, which is how the log grows with nothing tracking its length (Reference \, pure-data)., f 46;
#X text 1220 1300 The bng lives here \, not on the dev panel: reaching a sibling abstraction would take another bare global name. C-2, f 46;
#X obj 580 560 makefilename %d;
#X text 20 1450 The stamp is a symbol \, through makefilename: text writes a float with %g \, which loses precision 16 min 40 s in \, and this log is the only record of when anything happened (ref/module/error.md \, item 290)., f 78;
